OL,3,GNEWSA'Dick Turpin' pub to reopen with
OL,4,Anew investment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pub, believed to have been frequented
OL,7,Fby highwayman Dick Turpin, is set to
OL,8,Freopen after a #480,000 investment.
OL,10,FThe Grade II-listed Cock Inn in Sibson,
OL,11,Fnear Market Bosworth, Leicestershire,
OL,12,Fdates back more than 750 years but shut
OL,13,Fin 2019 and has been closed ever since.
OL,15,FMore than 2,500 people signed a
OL,16,Fpetition calling for the owners, Star
OL,17,FPubs Trading Limited, to repair and
OL,18,Freopen the building back in April of
OL,19,Fthis year.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
