OL,3,GNEWSA'Dick Turpin' pub to reopen with
OL,4,Anew investment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company's new licensee, Jason
OL,7,FBillingham, said the area's history and
OL,8,Fcommunity feel were both key factors in
OL,9,Fhim taking on the renovation before
OL,10,Freopening in November.
